  "Question": "In quadrilateral \\(ABCD\\), \\(AB\\parallel CD\\), \\(AB=2x+1\\), and \\(CD=3x-4\\) (unit: cm). What value must \\(x\\) take for quadrilateral \\(ABCD\\) to be a parallelogram?",
